Upload the source maps from the Volto 19 build folder, `core/packages/volto/build/public/static/js`, when `build/public/static/js` does not exist, or from `SENTRY_SOURCEMAPS_DIR`: the release script uploaded nothing in a Volto 19 project and still reported success. A missing build now skips the upload before the release is created, and a release whose upload fails is removed so that the next run uploads it again instead of skipping it as existing.
